**1. Create a histogram of math scores.**

```{r}

student_scores <- read.csv(here("Data", "hsb2.csv"), header = TRUE, sep = ",")

```



```{r}

ggplot(student_scores, aes(x = math)) +
  geom_histogram(binwidth = 5, fill = "skyblue", color = "white") +
  labs(
    title = "Distribution of Math Scores",
    x = "Math Score",
    y = "Count"
  ) +
  theme_minimal()

```


