**6. Create stacked bar plots to illustrate how SES groupings is related to the private-public school distinction. Plot proportions on the vertical axis.**

```{r}

# Creating stacked bar plot with proportions.

ggplot(student_scores, aes(x = schtyp, fill = ses)) +
  geom_bar(position = "fill") +  # "fill" makes it proportional
  scale_y_continuous(labels = scales::percent_format()) +  # Convert y-axis to percentages
  labs(
    title = "Relationship Between SES and School Type",
    x = "School Type",
    y = "Proportion",
    fill = "SES"
  ) +
  theme_minimal()

```


